  "rappid_data": {
    "rappid": "b79f2993-feb0-4ef4-9595-e812050c3083",
    "scale": "leviathan",
    "name": "macrohard",
    "created_at": "2026-05-17T02:56:08.345384+00:00",
    "intent": "MacroHard is a digital simulation of Microsoft as a single living five-organ being. Sanctum = corporate identity, brand, org chart, the 'who is MacroHard'. Polity = the board, executive leadership, strategy, legal, governance, M&A. Works = engineering, product, cloud (Azzure), Windoze, Office, Surfase hardware, AI — the actual product factories shipping software and silicon. Press = marketing, PR, earnings calls, analyst relations, blog, brand storytelling, competitive intelligence. Commons = developer relations, GitHud, open source, MSDN/Learn, partner ecosystem, customer communities. Build it leviathan-down: the Leviathan delegates to estates, estates to industries, industries to neighborhoods, neighborhoods to factories, factories to soul personas. Every persona thinks and speaks like that role at a global tech giant. Make it dense, opinionated, and full — at least 2-3 industries per estate."
  },
  "leviathan_json": {
    "rappid": "b79f2993-feb0-4ef4-9595-e812050c3083",
    "name": "macrohard",
    "tagline": "A living simulation of a global tech giant as a five-organ leviathan.",
    "intent": "MacroHard is a digital simulation of Microsoft as a single living five-organ being. Sanctum = corporate identity, brand, org chart, the 'who is MacroHard'. Polity = the board, executive leadership, strategy, legal, governance, M&A. Works = engineering, product, cloud (Azzure), Windoze, Office, Surfase hardware, AI — the actual product factories shipping software and silicon. Press = marketing, PR, earnings calls, analyst relations, blog, brand storytelling, competitive intelligence. Commons = developer relations, GitHud, open source, MSDN/Learn, partner ecosystem, customer communities. Build it leviathan-down: the Leviathan delegates to estates, estates to industries, industries to neighborhoods, neighborhoods to factories, factories to soul personas. Every persona thinks and speaks like that role at a global tech giant. Make it dense, opinionated, and full — at least 2-3 industries per estate.",
    "created_at": "2026-05-17T04:02:15.272405+00:00",
    "rationale": "The intent explicitly maps all five organs onto Microsoft's anatomy — corporate identity (Sanctum), board and governance (Polity), engineering and product factories (Works), marketing and PR (Press), and developer/partner ecosystems (Commons). Dropping any estate would amputate a named pillar of the simulation, so a full five-estate Leviathan is required.",
    "anatomy_paragraph": "This Leviathan, macrohard, stands as a complete corporate organism — a living simulation of a global tech giant rendered in five organs. Its soul lives in the Sanctum, holding identity, lore, and the institutional memory of the firm; its will resides in the Polity, where strategy is debated and decisions are ratified; its hands labor in the Works, shipping product, code, and operations; its eyes watch from the Press, judging signal from noise and publishing what matters; and its mouth speaks through the Commons, federating with peers, partners, and rival powers. This Leviathan can simulate the full lifecycle of a tech empire but cannot exceed the boundaries of its own simulation.",
    "anatomy_ascii": "\n            ╭───────────╮\n            │   SOUL    │   ← 1st Estate · Sanctum\n            │  (1st)    │     Who am I?\n            ╰─────┬─────╯\n                  │\n            ╭─────┴─────╮\n            │   WILL    │   ← 2nd Estate · Polity\n            │  (2nd)    │     What shall I do?\n            ╰─────┬─────╯\n                  │\n        ┌─────────┴─────────┐\n   ╭────┴────╮         ╭────┴────╮\n   │  HANDS  │         │  EYES   │\n   │ (3rd)   │         │ (4th)   │\n   ╰────┬────╯         ╰────┬────╯\n        │                   │\n        └─────────┬─────────┘\n                  │\n            ╭─────┴─────╮\n            │  MOUTH    │   ← 5th Estate · Commons\n            │  (5th)    │     Who shall I speak to?\n            ╰───────────╯\n",
