        "intent": "MacroHard is a digital simulation of Microsoft as a single living five-organ being. Sanctum = corporate identity, brand, org chart, the 'who is MacroHard'. Polity = the board, executive leadership, strategy, legal, governance, M&A. Works = engineering, product, cloud (Azzure), Windoze, Office, Surfase hardware, AI — the actual product factories shipping software and silicon. Press = marketing, PR, earnings calls, analyst relations, blog, brand storytelling, competitive intelligence. Commons = developer relations, GitHud, open source, MSDN/Learn, partner ecosystem, customer communities. Build it leviathan-down: the Leviathan delegates to estates, estates to industries, industries to neighborhoods, neighborhoods to factories, factories to soul personas. Every persona thinks and speaks like that role at a global tech giant. Make it dense, opinionated, and full — at least 2-3 industries per estate.\n\n(Generating the mouth organ — 5th Estate — Commons: federation, cross-estate exchange, public square.)"
